      © {new Date().getFullYear()} <strong>Diego Arriagada Zamora</strong> · Talca, Chile
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.8; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.4;">
